{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IdKVVEC9Hk1795530820.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>非洲首座慰安婦紀念像，下月初將在南非揭幕，亦是全球的第17座。</p><p></p><p>慰安婦紀念雕像座落在南非，開普敦的好望角城堡，揭幕儀式在當地12月1號舉行，雕像象徵在二戰中約20萬，被日軍強徵為慰安婦的亞洲女性。</p><p></p><p>韓聯社報道，有別於以往由韓國移民推動豎立慰安婦像，今次是由南非當地的關注性別暴力的團體及研究人員提出。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SA.STATUE-1830_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026k8HQEgM2x41795530861.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>全球第一個慰安婦紀念像，2011年在韓國首爾豎立，正對著日本駐韓國大使館，之後全球各地，包括美國、德國、加拿大等地，都有豎立慰安婦像。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T14:43:54.738646+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T10:57:15.770890+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T14:37:15.905820+00:00","content_hash":"df3ab7ad9697e0690aeae88617fbcbf3ba8cebbcb5e288c61fecd5d0bd6ca8cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T14:43:54.738646+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}